oking for information on [topic], specifically in relation to [aspect]. Is that right?\"\n\nBy using these tactics, you'll be able to navigate the situation with confidence, even when faced with a question outside your area of expertise. And who knows, you might even be able to turn the tables and use the conversation as an opportunity to learn something new and gain an advantage in the process."}]}
